(6509030, 967731, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ugh. Hate to say this, but I think you ruined a really nice shot with selective desat. ...oh, and you used text. tsk tsk tsk. I''d like to see this in color if you feel like posting it after the challenge.</td>', 'Ugh. Hate to say this, but I think you ruined a really nice shot with selective desat. ...oh, and you used text. tsk tsk tsk. I''d like to see this in color if you feel like posting it after the challenge.', '2011-08-19 02:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
