(6509170, 968060, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I like the composition. I wish the lighting was more even.</td>', 'Good idea. I like the composition. I wish the lighting was more even.', '2011-08-19 08:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509198, 968043, 73942, '<td valign="top">ah, that''s just too cute, whata a good model you''ve got there</td>', 'ah, that''s just too cute, whata a good model you''ve got there', '2011-08-19 08:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509199, 967731, 73942, '<td valign="top">I''m liking the selective desat, would also like to see the color version of this.</td>', 'I''m liking the selective desat, would also like to see the color version of this.', '2011-08-19 08:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509200, 967137, 73942, '<td valign="top">love the reflection in the windows and the dog waiting for you to arrive</td>', 'love the reflection in the windows and the dog waiting for you to arrive', '2011-08-19 08:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509207, 967137, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh, I have to look twice :-) <br/>really lovely!</td>', 'oh, I have to look twice :-) really lovely!', '2011-08-19 08:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509208, 967682, 69368, '<td valign="top">a tad too soft for my eyes, otherwise I like the romantic look</td>', 'a tad too soft for my eyes, otherwise I like the romantic look', '2011-08-19 08:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509235, 968098, 129807, '<td valign="top">This one made me stop and look a little longer. I think I would have liked a smidgen more dof maybe?</td>', 'This one made me stop and look a little longer. I think I would have liked a smidgen more dof maybe?', '2011-08-19 09:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509237, 968014, 10785, '<td valign="top">You have captured a lovely pastoral scene. I like the contrast with the really dark darks and the soft white fog. I think that the foreground ought to be a hair brighter. The details seem to be lost. Also though the soft feel is good for the scene, I would like a touch more sharpness in the tree which appears to be the subject. You did very well with the B&amp;W conversion and again the contrast is what makes this image.</td>', 'You have captured a lovely pastoral scene. I like the contrast with the really dark darks and the soft white fog. I think that the foreground ought to be a hair brighter. The details seem to be lost. Also though the soft feel is good for the scene, I would like a touch more sharpness in the tree which appears to be the subject. You did very well with the B&W conversion and again the contrast is what makes this image.', '2011-08-19 09:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509238, 968069, 10785, '<td valign="top">Super Awesome HDR.</td>', 'Super Awesome HDR.', '2011-08-19 09:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509239, 968076, 129807, '<td valign="top">Interesting use for a mailbox. The plants at the front seem a little out of focus to me, but I like the concept.</td>', 'Interesting use for a mailbox. The plants at the front seem a little out of focus to me, but I like the concept.', '2011-08-19 09:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509240, 968078, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very well framed. Awesome perspective and great detail in the lines of the brick. No noticeable jpg jaggies which are always trouble when it comes to re-sizing photos of brick walls.</td>', 'Very well framed. Awesome perspective and great detail in the lines of the brick. No noticeable jpg jaggies which are always trouble when it comes to re-sizing photos of brick walls.', '2011-08-19 09:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509242, 968055, 129807, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually fond of abstract-ish pics, but I like the play of colors and lines in this.</td>', 'I''m not usually fond of abstract-ish pics, but I like the play of colors and lines in this.', '2011-08-19 09:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509243, 967137, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot is simple and to the point. Nicely composed and good color and brightness. It works well for the challenge.</td>', 'This shot is simple and to the point. Nicely composed and good color and brightness. It works well for the challenge.', '2011-08-19 09:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509246, 968032, 129807, '<td valign="top">This comes up with quite vivid colors on my monitor and seems quite noisy. Was this the effect you were going for?</td>', 'This comes up with quite vivid colors on my monitor and seems quite noisy. Was this the effect you were going for?', '2011-08-19 09:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509247, 967682, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the dreamy still life scene. I think your choice of processing is counter intuitive to the message you are trying to communicate. The high-key, soft focus processing along with the tones used leave me with a cold, icy feeling. I feel like I am looking at a memorial of some sort.</td>', 'I like the dreamy still life scene. I think your choice of processing is counter intuitive to the message you are trying to communicate. The high-key, soft focus processing along with the tones used leave me with a cold, icy feeling. I feel like I am looking at a memorial of some sort.', '2011-08-19 09:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509248, 967220, 10785, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot but not really a good subject for the challenge. Though I am sure this is a typical scene for you in your front yard, it doesn''t say "Home" to me.</td>', 'Awesome shot but not really a good subject for the challenge. Though I am sure this is a typical scene for you in your front yard, it doesn''t say "Home" to me.', '2011-08-19 09:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509250, 967912, 129807, '<td valign="top">I''m really sorry but I''m not sure I understand this. It seems to be very soft focus on a fairly uninspiring view with a seriously solid vignette.</td>', 'I''m really sorry but I''m not sure I understand this. It seems to be very soft focus on a fairly uninspiring view with a seriously solid vignette.', '2011-08-19 09:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509255, 967455, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great processing here! I would like to see more in the photo. The view shown is a-typical for a picture of a home. Perhaps adding a person to the deck sweeping or something could help. I really like the tones and the contrast and the added grain. It is from another era for sure!</td>', 'Great processing here! I would like to see more in the photo. The view shown is a-typical for a picture of a home. Perhaps adding a person to the deck sweeping or something could help. I really like the tones and the contrast and the added grain. It is from another era for sure!', '2011-08-19 09:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509256, 967015, 129807, '<td valign="top">Good composition - leads my eye back to the cat''s face.</td>', 'Good composition - leads my eye back to the cat''s face.', '2011-08-19 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509257, 968055, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great color!</td>', 'Great color!', '2011-08-19 09:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509259, 968079, 129807, '<td valign="top">I like the processing on this - the red barn is muted yet vibrant enough to be the centre of attention. The roof tip being cut off is a little distracting - and it took me a while to notice the cat, but when I did it set it off nicely.</td>', 'I like the processing on this - the red barn is muted yet vibrant enough to be the centre of attention. The roof tip being cut off is a little distracting - and it took me a while to notice the cat, but when I did it set it off nicely.', '2011-08-19 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509260, 967731, 10785, '<td valign="top">I give it a 10.</td>', 'I give it a 10.', '2011-08-19 09:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509261, 967972, 129807, '<td valign="top">The sharp/gritty processing suits the scene very well. Wonderful composition playing the verticals. I really like this.</td>', 'The sharp/gritty processing suits the scene very well. Wonderful composition playing the verticals. I really like this.', '2011-08-19 09:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509263, 967982, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is suffering from being handheld at very slow shutter speeds. Nothing is sharp due to severe camera shake. Otherwise the composition is superb! I like the muted color but I think the exposure could be a tad brighter. You did well to get the sky exposed nicely without the foreground being too dark.</td>', 'I think this is suffering from being handheld at very slow shutter speeds. Nothing is sharp due to severe camera shake. Otherwise the composition is superb! I like the muted color but I think the exposure could be a tad brighter. You did well to get the sky exposed nicely without the foreground being too dark.', '2011-08-19 09:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509268, 968081, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting technique. It''s a little dark but very cool. Keep experimenting with it!</td>', 'Interesting technique. It''s a little dark but very cool. Keep experimenting with it!', '2011-08-19 09:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509269, 967159, 129807, '<td valign="top">The distinct angles present are a bit distracting. Was there water on the lens when you took this - I think that''s what I can see?</td>', 'The distinct angles present are a bit distracting. Was there water on the lens when you took this - I think that''s what I can see?', '2011-08-19 09:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509271, 967020, 69368, '<td valign="top">this is a so wonderful image! But I''m not susre if it meets the challenge very well...<br/>In a free study I would give 8 or 9 points.  <br/>o.k. I''ll think it over and I''ll come back later for voting</td>', 'this is a so wonderful image! But I''m not susre if it meets the challenge very well...In a free study I would give 8 or 9 points.  o.k. I''ll think it over and I''ll come back later for voting', '2011-08-19 09:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509275, 968080, 10785, '<td valign="top">Putting a couple of people in the scene would have made it much, much better!</td>', 'Putting a couple of people in the scene would have made it much, much better!', '2011-08-19 09:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509276, 967664, 10785, '<td valign="top">The silver surfer rides again!</td>', 'The silver surfer rides again!', '2011-08-19 09:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509283, 968010, 113156, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.', '2011-08-19 09:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509345, 968105, 98339, '<td valign="top">Lord, wouldn''t that be great....where is this???  Do you want a house guest???</td>', 'Lord, wouldn''t that be great....where is this???  Do you want a house guest???', '2011-08-19 11:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509348, 967020, 98339, '<td valign="top">Man I really want a little slice of your life....Margaret? You live in such a beautiful region and certainly face the right direction!!</td>', 'Man I really want a little slice of your life....Margaret? You live in such a beautiful region and certainly face the right direction!!', '2011-08-19 11:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509351, 967020, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene.  The clouds have such texture. :)</td>', 'Lovely scene.  The clouds have such texture. :)', '2011-08-19 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509353, 967938, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  California ranch style?  I like the Arts and Crafts color scheme (I''m totally into architectural styles)  Bring out the coffee pot - I''m on the way. ;)</td>', 'Very nice.  California ranch style?  I like the Arts and Crafts color scheme (I''m totally into architectural styles)  Bring out the coffee pot - I''m on the way. ;)', '2011-08-19 11:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509354, 967920, 15711, '<td valign="top">Mastiff?  Love it. :)</td>', 'Mastiff?  Love it. :)', '2011-08-19 11:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509358, 968072, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s so interesting how differently we live.  If I saw that, I would think it was a hotel or an office hallway (living in the midst of suburbia myself).  I''ve always wanted to live in a loft converted from an old building, with the old Chicago style brick. This has a geometry to it, which I enjoy. Are the walls marble?  I like the reflections. :)  Great modern chair too.</td>', 'It''s so interesting how differently we live.  If I saw that, I would think it was a hotel or an office hallway (living in the midst of suburbia myself).  I''ve always wanted to live in a loft converted from an old building, with the old Chicago style brick. This has a geometry to it, which I enjoy. Are the walls marble?  I like the reflections. :)  Great modern chair too.', '2011-08-19 11:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509362, 968062, 15711, '<td valign="top">So inviting.  You don''t see much of those courtyard areas here in central Texas.  I love the hanging baskets.  Put on a pot of coffee - I''m on my way over. :)</td>', 'So inviting.  You don''t see much of those courtyard areas here in central Texas.  I love the hanging baskets.  Put on a pot of coffee - I''m on my way over. :)', '2011-08-19 11:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509363, 967950, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s so interesting how different the coastlines are in different areas.  The Texas Gulf Coast is so flat. The water is warm. The first time I put my foot in the Pacific, I thought it was so cold!!  LOVELY scene.</td>', 'It''s so interesting how different the coastlines are in different areas.  The Texas Gulf Coast is so flat. The water is warm. The first time I put my foot in the Pacific, I thought it was so cold!!  LOVELY scene.', '2011-08-19 11:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509364, 967455, 15711, '<td valign="top">Like a scene from old crime photos.  Love the grain.</td>', 'Like a scene from old crime photos.  Love the grain.', '2011-08-19 11:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509366, 968033, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my.  What a lovely staircase.  Is that the Aegean?</td>', 'Oh my.  What a lovely staircase.  Is that the Aegean?', '2011-08-19 11:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509368, 968099, 15711, '<td valign="top">A bit contrived, but darling.  If it were me, I''d have shot, so that you see her, the star bubble maker and the clouds and bubbles only.  Just me.  She''s precious.</td>', 'A bit contrived, but darling.  If it were me, I''d have shot, so that you see her, the star bubble maker and the clouds and bubbles only.  Just me.  She''s precious.', '2011-08-19 11:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509371, 968069, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is lovely. I just can''t imagine high rise living, having grown up with lots of green grass and a fenced yard.  I love to see how other people live.  The image is really well done.  Love the clouds and the sweeping curve of the marble (?) outside of the rail. Looks like a terrific place to have a cocktail. :)</td>', 'Oh this is lovely. I just can''t imagine high rise living, having grown up with lots of green grass and a fenced yard.  I love to see how other people live.  The image is really well done.  Love the clouds and the sweeping curve of the marble (?) outside of the rail. Looks like a terrific place to have a cocktail. :)', '2011-08-19 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509373, 967159, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I LOVE this house.  What style is it?  I''m always so captivated by the varying architectural styles.  My only nit is that it seems too tilted to the right. I want to walk down that path and go into the door.  I bet I''d smell something wonderful cooking. :)</td>', 'Oh I LOVE this house.  What style is it?  I''m always so captivated by the varying architectural styles.  My only nit is that it seems too tilted to the right. I want to walk down that path and go into the door.  I bet I''d smell something wonderful cooking. :)', '2011-08-19 11:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509375, 967951, 15711, '<td valign="top">The California beaches are so recognizable.  Love the dots of color from the umbrellas.  This almost looks like a painting.</td>', 'The California beaches are so recognizable.  Love the dots of color from the umbrellas.  This almost looks like a painting.', '2011-08-19 11:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509376, 967972, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Looks like the setting for a movie.  The lampposts are what make it for me.  Terrific tones of grey.</td>', 'Very nice.  Looks like the setting for a movie.  The lampposts are what make it for me.  Terrific tones of grey.', '2011-08-19 11:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509379, 967220, 15711, '<td valign="top">HA HA  Love the title.  I just find dear so wonderful.  We have them near our house too.  With a greenbelt nearby, sometimes they are running across the street at night and you can hear their hooves clopping on the pavement. :)</td>', 'HA HA  Love the title.  I just find dear so wonderful.  We have them near our house too.  With a greenbelt nearby, sometimes they are running across the street at night and you can hear their hooves clopping on the pavement. :)', '2011-08-19 11:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509382, 967137, 15711, '<td valign="top">Your front entry is similar to mine.  Do you have nose prints all over the inside transoms?  I sure do. LOL</td>', 'Your front entry is similar to mine.  Do you have nose prints all over the inside transoms?  I sure do. LOL', '2011-08-19 11:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509383, 968010, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I wish their feet weren''t chopped at the bottom. :)</td>', 'Cute idea.  I wish their feet weren''t chopped at the bottom. :)', '2011-08-19 11:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509384, 967015, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE this.  It has such a sunny feel.</td>', 'LOVE this.  It has such a sunny feel.', '2011-08-19 11:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509402, 967646, 132251, '<td valign="top">I am sensing a them here... You must really love this thing. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=966528" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">===W===</a></td>', 'I am sensing a them here... You must really love this thing. ===W===', '2011-08-19 11:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
