(6509941, 968089, 10785, '<td valign="top">Hey, you''re a week early on this shot!! j/k. It''s a good shot for this challenge as the home feeling is given and works especially well if you''re used to coming home drunk!</td>', 'Hey, you''re a week early on this shot!! j/k. It''s a good shot for this challenge as the home feeling is given and works especially well if you''re used to coming home drunk!', '2011-08-19 22:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
