(6511173, 967950, 96664, '<td valign="top">This looks awesome! I have always wanted to go to California. Because it is advanced editing I would have gotten rid of that thing in the water... Boat? Rock? Either way it is a touch distracting to the horizon line. Other than that this is awesome!</td>', 'This looks awesome! I have always wanted to go to California. Because it is advanced editing I would have gotten rid of that thing in the water... Boat? Rock? Either way it is a touch distracting to the horizon line. Other than that this is awesome!', '2011-08-21 18:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511174, 967900, 96664, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but I fear that a lot of people will say that this does not my the challenge. Which is where I stand. Right picture for the wrong challenge if that makes sense.</td>', 'I like the idea but I fear that a lot of people will say that this does not my the challenge. Which is where I stand. Right picture for the wrong challenge if that makes sense.', '2011-08-21 18:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
