(6511177, 967912, 96664, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t do it for me.. But I know some people on this site will like it. Mostly the people who do the abstracts.</td>', 'Doesn''t do it for me.. But I know some people on this site will like it. Mostly the people who do the abstracts.', '2011-08-21 18:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
