(6511183, 968027, 96664, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a last minute entry. Did you take your time setting this up? Background of the utensils is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Looks too much like a last minute entry. Did you take your time setting this up? Background of the utensils is a bit distracting.', '2011-08-21 18:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
