(6512062, 967020, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. Wonderful HDR and processing.</td>', 'This is amazing. Wonderful HDR and processing.', '2011-08-22 12:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512064, 967015, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this. Nice warm tones. Funny perspective.</td>', 'I like the colors in this. Nice warm tones. Funny perspective.', '2011-08-22 12:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512065, 967102, 125275, '<td valign="top">Hey that looks like Fruity Pebbles! :) The lighting here is well done.</td>', 'Hey that looks like Fruity Pebbles! :) The lighting here is well done.', '2011-08-22 12:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512068, 968055, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and cropping. Pictures like this (more in the artistic, abstract direction) are so much better with something (anything!) in focus, so the single blade of grass in front really adds a lot to this image.</td>', 'Nice colors and cropping. Pictures like this (more in the artistic, abstract direction) are so much better with something (anything!) in focus, so the single blade of grass in front really adds a lot to this image.', '2011-08-22 12:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512069, 967972, 125275, '<td valign="top">Really nice tones. Very beautiful PP. I''d be interested to hear some techniques about this processing.</td>', 'Really nice tones. Very beautiful PP. I''d be interested to hear some techniques about this processing.', '2011-08-22 12:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512071, 968040, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and clarity. If I were to shoot this I''d likely end up with a muddled, busy mess, but you pulled it off well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice colors and clarity. If I were to shoot this I''d likely end up with a muddled, busy mess, but you pulled it off well. Nicely done.', '2011-08-22 12:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512075, 968099, 125275, '<td valign="top">In the thumbnail it looks like she''s blowing the cloud out like smoke. :-D Cute moment.</td>', 'In the thumbnail it looks like she''s blowing the cloud out like smoke. :-D Cute moment.', '2011-08-22 12:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512076, 967178, 125275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. Looks like a pretty area.</td>', 'Beautiful picture. Looks like a pretty area.', '2011-08-22 12:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512079, 968069, 125275, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this is an HDR or a long exposure. The blurry leaves make it seem like the latter. (That''s not a criticism.) The processing of this image is superb.</td>', 'I wonder if this is an HDR or a long exposure. The blurry leaves make it seem like the latter. (That''s not a criticism.) The processing of this image is superb.', '2011-08-22 12:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512082, 967951, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the frame, it makes it look like a postcard. A little sharpening might help bring out the details, but I like this image!</td>', 'I like the frame, it makes it look like a postcard. A little sharpening might help bring out the details, but I like this image!', '2011-08-22 12:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512183, 968047, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details in the wood.</td>', 'Great details in the wood.', '2011-08-22 14:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512184, 968099, 114225, '<td valign="top">Amazingly cute image with a great composition.</td>', 'Amazingly cute image with a great composition.', '2011-08-22 14:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512185, 967904, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice socks.</td>', 'Nice socks.', '2011-08-22 14:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512186, 968070, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well done. I especially like how the depth of field is spot on to help tell the story.</td>', 'Well done. I especially like how the depth of field is spot on to help tell the story.', '2011-08-22 14:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512192, 968054, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the raven on the roof is watching you.</td>', 'I like how the raven on the roof is watching you.', '2011-08-22 14:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512199, 968069, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of HDR, although the blurry plant in the lower right is pretty distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful use of HDR, although the blurry plant in the lower right is pretty distracting.', '2011-08-22 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512202, 967906, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun and cute setup.</td>', 'Fun and cute setup.', '2011-08-22 14:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512204, 967972, 114225, '<td valign="top">I very much enjoy the mood of this photo.</td>', 'I very much enjoy the mood of this photo.', '2011-08-22 14:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512210, 967020, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool scene, and I like the play of the clouds against the trees. But I don''t like the end processing result at all. It''s just to harsh in the edges with some unflattering halo effects around the trees.</td>', 'Very cool scene, and I like the play of the clouds against the trees. But I don''t like the end processing result at all. It''s just to harsh in the edges with some unflattering halo effects around the trees.', '2011-08-22 14:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512215, 967159, 114225, '<td valign="top">Watch out for the wide angle lens distortion. This is not something I really started noticing until recently, but now when I do see it, it really bothers me.</td>', 'Watch out for the wide angle lens distortion. This is not something I really started noticing until recently, but now when I do see it, it really bothers me.', '2011-08-22 14:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512217, 968080, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ghostly conversations...<br/> <br/>This is one shot that could really use some people.</td>', 'Ghostly conversations... This is one shot that could really use some people.', '2011-08-22 14:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512223, 968030, 114225, '<td valign="top">This shot just isn''t my cup of tea (bwa-ahahaha!).<br/> <br/>Ok, sorry for that. But I really think this could have been more powerful with better concentration on the main subject, with potentially some depth of field to blur out the annoying television.</td>', 'This shot just isn''t my cup of tea (bwa-ahahaha!). Ok, sorry for that. But I really think this could have been more powerful with better concentration on the main subject, with potentially some depth of field to blur out the annoying television.', '2011-08-22 14:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512480, 967178, 38725, '<td valign="top">The deeper I look into the image the more surreal it feels, I''m not sure if that is the processing or just the image itself but I like it, nice shot ;)</td>', 'The deeper I look into the image the more surreal it feels, I''m not sure if that is the processing or just the image itself but I like it, nice shot ;)', '2011-08-22 20:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512482, 968010, 38725, '<td valign="top">I like the eye contact, really makes the image stand out at me, you have really captured something here which makes me smile and keep looking.</td>', 'I like the eye contact, really makes the image stand out at me, you have really captured something here which makes me smile and keep looking.', '2011-08-22 20:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512483, 968002, 38725, '<td valign="top">Nice moody capture, some haloing around the sides of the stonework but nice image regardless.</td>', 'Nice moody capture, some haloing around the sides of the stonework but nice image regardless.', '2011-08-22 20:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512484, 968098, 38725, '<td valign="top">Nice poignant image</td>', 'Nice poignant image', '2011-08-22 20:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6512487, 968089, 38725, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2011-08-22 20:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
