(6514299, 967733, 12611, '<td valign="top">great in black and white, the term "washing" implies European, most likely British, as does the polka-dot bra, slate roof and shrubbery, which, when coupled with the lamp and detail on the posts and house could also say, France, perhaps Normandy Region. Either way its a fun shot, good capture.</td>', 'great in black and white, the term "washing" implies European, most likely British, as does the polka-dot bra, slate roof and shrubbery, which, when coupled with the lamp and detail on the posts and house could also say, France, perhaps Normandy Region. Either way its a fun shot, good capture.', '2011-08-24 12:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
