(6514381, 968007, 12611, '<td valign="top">I am trying to figure out the title- does it mean overseas is where you are from- and you can''t get home yet? or perhaps on an island and you can only get to the dock? or maybe you are a selkie and can''t find you skin, or a mermaid. or you just theoretically pine for the sea that you can''t get back to, the home of your soul, for reasons of having a cast on that can''t get wet- or because you don''t have a boat. <br/> <br/>Anyway, nice texture and shot.</td>', 'I am trying to figure out the title- does it mean overseas is where you are from- and you can''t get home yet? or perhaps on an island and you can only get to the dock? or maybe you are a selkie and can''t find you skin, or a mermaid. or you just theoretically pine for the sea that you can''t get back to, the home of your soul, for reasons of having a cast on that can''t get wet- or because you don''t have a boat.  Anyway, nice texture and shot.', '2011-08-24 12:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
