(6514751, 968070, 137358, '<td valign="top">Nice concept for the challenge.<br/>The central intrest is well focused, nice and tight, and the colour saturation is antique enough that it enhances the picture.<br/>Did you consider treating it as a sepia BW shot? just a thought.<br/>I down graded slightly because the left of the sign is slightly out of focus, which to me degrades from the overall impact. (but that is me being picky)</td>', 'Nice concept for the challenge.The central intrest is well focused, nice and tight, and the colour saturation is antique enough that it enhances the picture.Did you consider treating it as a sepia BW shot? just a thought.I down graded slightly because the left of the sign is slightly out of focus, which to me degrades from the overall impact. (but that is me being picky)', '2011-08-24 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514753, 968105, 137358, '<td valign="top">There is beauty and peace in this capture. and a fine control of focus and saturation.<br/>But to me the rocks on the shore and the house have a soft focus which should not be there. The house should be in Sharp bold focus to punch it out in the picture. <br/>The detail and movement in the trees is great, and lift the picture.</td>', 'There is beauty and peace in this capture. and a fine control of focus and saturation.But to me the rocks on the shore and the house have a soft focus which should not be there. The house should be in Sharp bold focus to punch it out in the picture. The detail and movement in the trees is great, and lift the picture.', '2011-08-24 17:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
