(6516225, 967015, 30982, '<td valign="top">My 50mm broke into two pieces when it hit the floor.  I carefully put it back together again and still use it.  The autofocus isn''t as auto as it once was, but the lens still shoots just fine.  You may want to see what you can do with it!  Oh, and I love the shot, too.  Thanks for the story behind it as well!</td>', 'My 50mm broke into two pieces when it hit the floor.  I carefully put it back together again and still use it.  The autofocus isn''t as auto as it once was, but the lens still shoots just fine.  You may want to see what you can do with it!  Oh, and I love the shot, too.  Thanks for the story behind it as well!', '2011-08-26 02:02:42.000000', NULL, 0),
