(6841567, 967950, 42013, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by antje1777:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> If I thought you really DID live there in Big Sur I''d be wildly jealous :-) I remember trespassing on that beach once, back in the 1970''s -- got chased off by an angry rancher. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hehe...20 miles away from this shot...:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was just going to ask if you''ve ever tried to access this beach... the last time I drove past i considered hopping the fence but the signs were pretty obvious as I recall. Someday...<br/> <br/>@ Bear -- maybe the Rancher has sold his property to a nicer rancher.</td>', 'Originally posted by antje1777: Originally posted by Bear_Music: If I thought you really DID live there in Big Sur I''d be wildly jealous :-) I remember trespassing on that beach once, back in the 1970''s -- got chased off by an angry rancher.  Hehe...20 miles away from this shot...:)   I was just going to ask if you''ve ever tried to access this beach... the last time I drove past i considered hopping the fence but the signs were pretty obvious as I recall. Someday... @ Bear -- maybe the Rancher has sold his property to a nicer rancher.', '2012-08-15 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 0),
